@COPY
Syntax: Copy [<opts>] <srcpath> [<dstpath>] [<opts>]
Usage : Copies files
Opts  :
  -a = abort on error
  -d = copy directories and everything in them
  -p = don't print files copied (use with -w or -d)
  -r = rewrite destination
  -s = single drive copy 
  -v = verify the copy
  -w=<dir> = copy to <dir>
  -x = copy from exec dir
